  "description": "Run the list of client sites of a parent tenant day to day: filter by state, sort, fix a setup that failed, suspend and resume several clients at once, use favorites and sign out of every client, and see what the platform does with orphans, moves and parents without clients.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why operations matter\n• Finding and sorting the clients, and the state filter\n• Fixing a setup that failed: Retry or Discard\n• Bulk Suspend, Resume, Reload and Remove\n• Favorites and signing out of every client\n• What the platform does: orphans, moving and making ordinary\n• Clients changed by the platform\n• What it is for",
